# watson's pull-only copy of the LX convenor mailbox for wiz (wiz decision-4),
# run by wiz's admin/tools/watson-run as `mbsync -c ~/.dotfiles/mail/mbsyncrc-wiz
# lxconvenor`. Pull only: daysy is the one full client (README.md), and wiz
# never changes the mailbox. The token comes from the file backend because
# watson is reached over ssh, where its login keychain refuses access.

IMAPAccount lxconvenor
Host outlook.office365.com
Port 993
AuthMech XOAUTH2
User lxconvenor.cybernetics@anu.edu.au
PassCmd "MAIL_SECRET_BACKEND=file $HOME/.dotfiles/bin/mail-secret oauth anu"
TLSType IMAPS
PipelineDepth 1
Timeout 120

IMAPStore lxconvenor-remote
Account lxconvenor

MaildirStore lxconvenor-local
Path ~/wiz-mail/lxconvenor/
Inbox ~/wiz-mail/lxconvenor/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel lxconvenor
Far :lxconvenor-remote:
Near :lxconvenor-local:
Patterns INBOX Archive "Sent Items" "Deleted Items"
Create Near
Remove Near
Sync Pull
Expunge Near
SyncState *
CopyArrivalDate yes
